# Builds CEE_Supplementary_Tables_v0.9.24.xlsx and one UTF-8 CSV per sheet in the output folder.
# Usage (from the repository root): python3 code/build_supplement.py --out OUTPUT_FOLDER
# Public copy of the author's build script: only the input/output paths differ.
# v0.9.23: author display name in the file properties and README (SeungJin Kim, as designated by the author); tables unchanged. v0.9.21: tables unchanged; built against manuscript v0.9.24 (reference list reduced to 21; no table text or count changed). v0.9.20: C15 site link recorded as resolved with secondary sources (Colo-X page; ISPreview indexed text); no verdict or count changed. v0.9.19: roles stated in the README (author reviewed the originals; GPT and Claude entries are AI-assisted verification paths); reader column headings renamed; cell contents (documents, pages, access method, limits) unchanged. v0.9.18: S2 cell C23 / Spending carried out classed as matched to page (auditor ruling of 18 November 2026), class counts 21 / 3 / 1 / 2 / 29; S2 column headings brought up to date. v0.9.17: Wenatchee payment example anchored on check 13482 (28 June 2024), with transaction-level rows in S5 and the earlier single-reading cheque kept and labelled; S1 title brought up to date. v0.9.16: S1 two verdicts read from the auditor source check of 17 November 2026 (S1_two_verdicts_GPT_audit_2026-11-17b.csv): C02 and C18 corrected from not identified to not judged because their sources are event-scope; each endpoint 7 not identified, 20 not judged, 0 identified. v0.9.14: S7 incident-table pages for P1143, P1168 and P1173 added from the auditor reading; no count changed. v0.9.12: C07 demolition stated complete (local press of 24 August 2022 quoting the planning officer report), totals 27 / 21 / 7 / 4 / 2 / 5; P1187-01 amendment note attributed to the EPA notice of 3 March 2026; S7 page limits marked. v0.9.11: tables unchanged from v0.9.10; built against manuscript v0.9.24 (abstract, legend and Discussion wording changed, no counts changed). v0.9.10: S3 records the 2026 amendment notes for P1168-01 and P1187-01 (after the reference date; not used); new S7 (annual environmental reports for 2025) with the incident counts recomputed and checked against the manuscript text; inputs carry English notes only; the XLSX is written with fixed timestamps so that repeated builds give identical bytes.
